#: src/schemas/org.gnome.shell.extensions.stage-manager.gschema.xml:14
msgid ""
"What happens when a window is maximized. \"none\" leaves it in place; "
"\"workspace\" moves it to a new empty workspace; \"stage\" gives it a stage "
"of its own on the current workspace (Stack layout, Groups mode). "
"Unmaximizing always returns the window, whatever this is set to now."
msgstr ""

